models/tec/farmer.py: n = 1 000 producers, K = 15 000 a year, D0 = 150 days at T = 1, floor DMIN = 100 days, p0 = 100
The interior equilibrium of the rule is stable only for e > 1 (spec-stability.md 6.1); for e < 1 the market is pinned and the
floor sets the outcome (spec-stability.md 6.1: the upper pin is at the price where all households work the floor). Both shown.

