Forced to the floor for e = 0.5 (the pinned market): income / K = (T * DMIN / D0)^(1 - 1 / e) * (DMIN / D0)... evaluated:
  T 1.00: floor-pinned price  225.00, income / K  1.500, ratio to T = 1:  1.000 = T^(1 - 1/e) =  1.000
